REASON
NEW FILES. The required example page, built on examples/shared/example.css:
  Hero  a six-card feed that loads on open, at three simulated speeds
  01    the template's live source, a card rendered from it, and its derived
        skeleton side by side, plus the inference table
  02    a playground over every config property, two templates, equivalent code,
        and an onShow/onHide log of time on screen
  03    the same loads with delay 0 / minDuration 0 against the defaults, with a
        timeline per lane
  04    mask mode over a live panel, with a byte-for-byte check after unmask
  05    sixteen misuses printing their thrown errors

Verified in headless Chrome: every section scripted through (lanes, refresh,
playground load and template switch, every error button) with no uncaught
errors, screenshots reviewed at 1280px, and no horizontal overflow at 390px.
Only the Chrome engine was available; Firefox and Safari were not tested.
